commit message:
Update S22-FeatureCollectionClass-member...

An instance of geo:FeatureCollection should only have outgoing rdfs:member going to geo:Feature instances
SPARQL rule changed from:
```			SELECT $this
			WHERE {
				$this rdfs:member ?feature .
				FILTER NOT EXISTS {
					?feature geo:hasGeometry geo:Geometry .
				}
			}```
to
```			SELECT $this
			WHERE {
				$this rdfs:member ?feature .
				FILTER NOT EXISTS {
					?feature a geo:Feature .
				}
			}```

allow redirect w/ trunc: info > file

because it's handy;
although there are still problems with "print expr > file"

[API] added struct LoadSpec, changed Fityk::load(),

using LoadSpec also internally,
